:: Tell me more! {"position":"900,475","size":"100,100"}
These are some pretty dangerous areas here, but you are safe in our town. Myself is always looking for good ingredients for my magic potions. Look out for herbs and berries on your way, bring me any ingredients and I will pay you good.

[[Let's discuss about something else->Wizard in town]]
